  "configuration_id": "config_038",
  "reason": "The current best is config_039 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + weighted, acc=0.7250). Evidence strongly supports scvi_n200 as the best RNA encoder, multiprofile over single, transformer over avgpool, and weighted over concat (0.7131 vs 0.6878 with resnet50). The only untested single-variable ablation of the best configuration is config_038, which swaps weighted→concat fusion while keeping all other settings identical. While weighted fusion outperformed concat in the resnet50 setting, the interaction between concat fusion and the higher-dimensional ViT-L features is untested and could theoretically yield a different relative performance. As the final experiment, this clean one-variable comparison is the most informative use of the remaining budget: it either confirms weighted fusion's superiority across image encoders or reveals an interaction effect, and it is the closest untested candidate to potentially challenge the current best."
}

